# CO-MDM-001 — Enterprise Master Data Management

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED**

## Principles

1. Admin Console is the single interface for business master data.
2. Seed / default catalogues remain reference data — never deleted by seed sync.
3. Seed sync **creates missing codes only** — never overwrites administrator edits.
4. Hierarchy: Category → Group → Product → Program (Product + Lender).
5. Operational dropdowns consume registries (fallback to preserved constants only).

